-- הסכם קיבוצי כללי ליישום רפורמת "עוז לתמורה" בחטיבות העליונות (14.8.2011),
-- המבוא: the parties — the Centre of Local Government for every local
-- authority save the three large cities, and the three large cities ("the
-- employers"), against ארגון המורים — and the recitals, which coin "רפורמת
-- עוז לתמורה" ("הרפורמה"): a reform applied in the upper divisions
-- gradually, over the school years תשע"ב to תשע"ה. By §1 the preamble is an
-- integral part of the agreement. The State is not a party: the Ministry of
-- Education and the Treasury assisted the negotiation (¶17), and the
-- Treasury's approval under §29 of the Budget Foundations Law follows the
-- signatures (the sign-off).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `oz-founding-common`

§ `פתיח`

-- akn:preamble/p1 The registrar's stamp: registered as a collective agreement on 15.11.2011, no. 7040/2011; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The signing line, its day handwritten (14 August 2011); no rule (the corpus dates the agreement 14.8.2011).
-- akn:preamble/p3 "Between"; no rule.

§§ `הצדדים`

-- ¶4–¶5: the Centre of Local Government signs for every local authority
-- save the three large cities, and the three large cities (Jerusalem,
-- Tel Aviv-Yafo, Haifa) sign for themselves; ¶6: together they are "the
-- employers". ¶9: the secondary teachers' organisation, "ארגון המורים"
-- (¶10).
@ref akn:preamble/p4 akn:preamble/p5 akn:preamble/p6 akn:preamble/p9 akn:preamble/p10
DECLARE `employer party to the Oz agreement` IS ONE OF
    `a local authority other than the three large cities`
    `the City of Jerusalem`
    `the City of Tel Aviv-Yafo`
    `the City of Haifa`

`the employers under the Oz agreement` MEANS
    LIST `a local authority other than the three large cities`, `the City of Jerusalem`, `the City of Tel Aviv-Yafo`, `the City of Haifa`

`the three large cities of the Oz agreement` MEANS LIST `the City of Jerusalem`, `the City of Tel Aviv-Yafo`, `the City of Haifa`

-- akn:preamble/p7 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 "And"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 "On the other side"; no rule.

§§ `ההצהרות`

-- akn:preamble/p12 A recital: the Ministry of Education supervises and funds education in the upper divisions; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 A recital: the national need to invest in education, and the Government's basic lines; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: the parties negotiated an agreed reform to raise the teacher's standing, pay and terms and the quality of teaching; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p15 A recital: the collective agreement of January 2008 agreed that the reform would build on the Oz LaTmura model; no rule (that agreement is l4/agreements/oz-latmura/2008-01-24_oz-latmura_tosefet-sachar_reform-model.l4).

-- ¶16 coins "רפורמת עוז לתמורה" or "הרפורמה": the reform the organisation
-- agreed to cooperate in, applied in the upper divisions gradually, over
-- the school years תשע"ב to תשע"ה.
@ref akn:preamble/p16
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a school year the Oz reform is phased in over` y IF
    `the school year` y `is from` `the school year 5772` `to` `the school year 5775`

-- akn:preamble/p17 A recital: the negotiation, assisted and guided by the Ministry of Education and the Treasury, on what a collective agreement must settle, the work week and pay above all; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p18 A recital: the parties wish to set their understandings down in a collective agreement; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p19 The operative formula ("לפיכך הוצהר, הותנה והוסכם"); no rule.

#ASSERT count `the employers under the Oz agreement` EQUALS 4
#ASSERT count `the three large cities of the Oz agreement` EQUALS 3
#ASSERT `a school year the Oz reform is phased in over` `the school year 5775`
#ASSERT NOT `a school year the Oz reform is phased in over` 2015
